- “Watch Personalized Cut” CTA;
- “Compare Cuts” CTA.

### `/director`

List available demo films.

For the hackathon, ship one seeded movie.

### `/director/movies/[movieId]`

Director Studio.

Must include:

- canonical video preview;
- visual timeline;
- three adaptive slot markers;
- slot inspector;
- constraints editor;
- generated variants;
- approve/reject controls;
- fallback preview;
- generate test variant action.

### `/watch`

Viewer profile selector.

### `/watch/[movieId]`

Adaptive player.

Must include:

- selected viewer profile;
- preparation status;
- adaptive video player;
- slot readiness indicators;
- cache hit/miss indicators;
- canonical fallback state;
- debug panel hidden by default.

### `/compare/[movieId]`

Three synchronized personalized cuts.

Must support:

- side-by-side playback;
- synchronized seek;
- profile labels;
- slot-by-slot jump controls;
- canonical comparison toggle.

### `/jobs`

Developer/demo operations screen.

Must show:

- queued jobs;
- active jobs;
- completed jobs;
- failed jobs;
- retry action;
- asset links;
- model used;
- cache key;
- duration;
- validation result.

