## 11. Cache Strategy

Build deterministic cache keys.

```ts
function buildCacheKey(input: {
  movieId: string;
  slotId: string;
  profile: ViewerProfile;
  manifestVersion: number;
  promptVersion: number;
  modelName: string;
}): string {
  const profileFingerprint = [
    input.profile.city.trim().toLowerCase(),
    input.profile.country.trim().toLowerCase(),
    input.profile.locale.trim().toLowerCase(),
    ...(input.profile.culturalContext ?? []).map(v => v.trim().toLowerCase())
  ].join("|");

  return [
    input.movieId,
    input.slotId,
    profileFingerprint,
    `manifest-${input.manifestVersion}`,
    `prompt-${input.promptVersion}`,
    input.modelName
  ].join(":");
}
```

Cache behavior:

1. Build key.
2. Look for approved, validated video asset.
3. If found:
   - mark as cache hit;
   - use immediately.
4. If not found:
   - create generation job;
   - keep fallback ready;
   - start generation.
5. Never block playback waiting for a job.

---

## 12. Generation Pipeline

### Pipeline overview

```text
Viewer profile selected
        ↓
Resolve movie manifest
        ↓
Build one cache key per slot
        ↓
Check approved cache
        ↓
Cache hit → mark slot READY
        ↓
Cache miss → enqueue generation job
        ↓
Generate image/keyframe with Nano Banana
        ↓
Validate image
        ↓
Generate or edit 3–6 second video with Omni
        ↓
Validate video
        ↓
Manual or automatic approval
        ↓
Store in cache
        ↓
Player uses generated asset when ready
        ↓
Otherwise player uses canonical fallback
```

### Image service interface

```ts
export interface ImageGenerationService {
  generateSlotImage(input: {
    movie: Movie;
    slot: AdaptiveSlot;
    profile: ViewerProfile;
  }): Promise<{
    assetUrl: string;
    prompt: string;
    rawResponseId?: string;
  }>;
}
```

### Video service interface

```ts
export interface VideoGenerationService {
  generateSlotVideo(input: {
    movie: Movie;
    slot: AdaptiveSlot;
    profile: ViewerProfile;
    imageAssetUrl?: string;
  }): Promise<{
    assetUrl: string;
    prompt: string;
    rawResponseId?: string;
  }>;
}
```

### Prompt builder interface

```ts
export interface PromptBuilder {
  buildImagePrompt(input: {
    movie: Movie;
    slot: AdaptiveSlot;
    profile: ViewerProfile;
  }): string;

  buildVideoPrompt(input: {
    movie: Movie;
    slot: AdaptiveSlot;
    profile: ViewerProfile;
    imageAssetUrl?: string;
  }): string;
}
```

