## 33. Final Build Priority

The application must prioritize, in this order:

1. Reliable playback
2. Clear director control
3. Visible personalization
4. Canonical fallback
5. Side-by-side comparison
6. Cache behavior
7. Live Nano Banana generation
8. Live Omni generation
9. Additional polish

Do not sacrifice the first five items to improve live generation.

---

## 34. Final Handoff Instruction to Antigravity

Build this as a desktop-first Next.js application named **Project Parallax**.

Start in `AI_MODE=mock`.

First make the entire product flow deterministic using seeded clips and images.

Then implement:

1. Director Studio
2. Viewer profiles
3. Segmented adaptive player
4. Cache and job system
5. Canonical fallback
6. Compare screen
7. Nano Banana integration
8. Omni integration

Use clean service boundaries so the model integrations can be replaced without changing the player or UI.

The completed application must remain fully demonstrable even when all AI calls fail.
